sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor PM as Pricing manager
  participant XL as Excel
  participant CK as Cockpit
  participant ENG as Rule Engine (host REST)
  actor CO as Compliance officer
  PM->>CK: Rule sets, card-fee, Export rows as CSV
  CK->>ENG: GET version 2 rows
  ENG-->>CK: rows R1 to R5
  CK-->>PM: card-fee-v2.csv
  PM->>XL: R3 fee 30000 VND to 35000 VND, save as CSV
  PM->>CK: Import CSV as draft
  CK->>ENG: create draft v3 from v2 with changed rows (Idempotency-Key)
  alt validation fails
    ENG-->>CK: 422 VALIDATION_FAILED, row R3, column fee
    CK-->>PM: Row R3, column fee: 35000 has no currency. Write 35000 VND.
  else valid
    ENG-->>CK: 201 DRAFT v3
  end
  PM->>CK: Simulation, upload 20 sample customers
  CK->>ENG: simulate v3 next to v2 (nothing logged)
  ENG-->>CK: 6 of 20 outcomes changed
  PM->>CK: Request approval, effective 2027-01-01
  CK->>ENG: request-publish
  ENG-->>CO: publish-requested event, via the bank's email or chat
  CO->>CK: Approvals, diff, approve (journey 3)
  alt approver is the requester
    ENG-->>CK: 403 SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN
  else rejected with a comment
    ENG-->>PM: v3 back to DRAFT with the comment
  else approved
    ENG-->>CK: PUBLISHED, effective 2027-01-01 00:00
  end
  Note over ENG: From 1 Jan every replica evaluates v3, v2 retires
